<title>GREECE: Greek 1M ATHIBOR stable at 10.42pct.</title>
<headline>Greek 1M ATHIBOR stable at 10.42pct.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate (Athibor) for one month was stable at 10.42 percent and the bid rate (Athibid) eased to 9.93 percent from 9.94 percent.</p>
<p>ATHIBOR</p>
